        {
          "text": " ahabwo'okuba akagaruka yaayombeka zaanyaruju z'omu myanya mikuru y'okuramizamu, ezi Hezekia ishe yaabaire asheenyire; yaayombekyera Baali amatambiro, yaakora Ashera nk'oku Ahabu omugabe wa Israeli yaabaire akora, kandi yaaguma naaramya eihe ryona ery'omu iguru, naariheereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.3",
