        {
          "text": " Ahabwa Manaase omugabe wa Yuda kukora ebirikunugwa ebyo, akakora ebibi ebirikukira obubi ebi Abaamori abaamubandiize baakozire byona, akasiisisa Abayuda ebishushani bye ebirikuramibwa; ",
