              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nikyo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugambira naagira ati: Reeba, naaza kureeta akabai ahari Yerusaalemu na Yuda, aku omuntu weena araahurire, amatu gakateera enduuru. ",
