          "text": " Ndyagyeresa Yerusaalemu akagoye nk'aku naagyereise Samaria, na kariisho ei naashwijumiise enju ya Ahabu; kandi ndyaragaza Yerusaalemu, nk'oku omuntu aragaza eshuhaani, akgijuumika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndyanaga ekicweka ekitsigaire aha buhunguzi bwangye, mbaheyo omu mikono y'abazigu baabo, bahindukye omuhiigo n'omunyago aharibo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ahakuba bakozire ebi ndikwanga, bangwisa kubi okwiha obu baishenkurubo baaruga Misri n'okuhitsya hati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.15"
            ]
