              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi Manaase akasheesha eshagama nyingi y'abataine rubanja, okuhitsya obu yaijwize Yerusaalemu okuruga aha rubaju okuhika aha rundi, akabyongyera aha kibi eki yaasiisiise Abayuda, bakakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
